3cp\u003e要是玉器工匠要同时关注宣传和销售，心境就会被杂念侵扰，难以制出杰作。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e因此，沉玉谷的玉器生产和销售是完全分开的。为的就是让玉器工匠们安心雕刻。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e也许你路过一座毫不起眼的民宅时，屋内便有一位玉器工匠在慢慢雕琢着手中的玉石。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欢迎光临丰泰百货，从生活用品到纪念的玉器，这里应有尽有！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【我看看商品…】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没问题，请客人随意挑选！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/07/75981509/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_6047811379228205657.png\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【玉器？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没错，本店也提供玉器定制服务，不过需要预约，加工时间也视玉器的精细程度而定。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e宝玦可遇而不可求，有缘购得的美玉才与客人相性最好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e暂时无法购得玉器，也未必是一件坏事…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"7k3wzwetvboT1717771943956\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[\"7k3wzwetvboT1717771943956\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1718012153","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207",